    "sub_name": "校外實習導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO OFF-CAMPUS INTERNSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "主要目的為銜接實習專業課程，使學生於進行專業實習前能充分瞭解實習企業的基本規範及相關職場禮儀，以利學生未來參與實習。",
    "describe_eh": "In order to connect with the internship program, this course is a preparatory course, which is designed to help students understand the job specification, business courtesy and working attitude for a enterprise before they join in the internship program. The students can be earlier familiar with the occupational ethics, regulations, and learning methods.",
